        "text": "Hi, this is Hermes, an AI assistant calling on behalf of Can. This call is not recorded.",
        "ts": "2026-11-06T22:01:33.319+00:00"
      },
      {
        "seq": 2,
        "speaker": "business",
        "text": "Thanks for calling. I",
        "ts": "2026-11-06T22:01:37.973+00:00"
      },
      {
        "seq": 3,
        "speaker": "hermes",
        "text": "Hi, this is Hermes, an AI assistant calling for Can. Am I speaking with a live person?",
        "ts": "2026-11-06T22:01:40.474+00:00"
      },
      {
        "seq": 4,
        "speaker": "business",
        "text": "No. You're speaking with Delta's automated virtual assistant.",
        "ts": "2026-11-06T22:01:55.486+00:00"
      },
      {
        "seq": 5,
        "speaker": "business",
        "text": "How can I help with your known traveler number today?",
        "ts": "2026-11-06T22:01:58.532+00:00"
      },
      {
        "seq": 6,
        "speaker": "hermes",
